WEB SOURCE BEHAVIOUR  (parity contract — read end-to-end; every branch reproduced)
  • First-run gate: localStorage['teslasync-onboarded']; if set, the component returns null (never shows).
  • On mount, when not onboarded, it reveals after a 1500 ms delay so the app paints + nav stays interactive.
  • Cross-tab bus: subscribe() dismisses this instance when a peer tab broadcasts {type:'onboarded'};
    handleClose() persists the flag, hides, and broadcasts {type:'onboarded'}.
  • Four steps (Welcome / Connect / Configure / All-Set): each a title, a description, a lucide icon, an accent hex.
  • Modal: backdrop (click = close) · centered glass panel · step-indicator dots (active wider + cyan glow) ·
    accent-tinted icon tile · title + description · Skip (left) + Next▸ / Get Started (right) · ✕ close · Esc closes.
  • handleNext: not-last → currentStep+1 ; last → handleClose().

PARITY MAPPING  (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported, no raw hex)
  steps[] (4)                  → OnboardingWizardStepCatalog.entries + OnboardingWizardProjection.steps() (P1/S10 keys)
